tools.description:
Run JavaScript that composes Claude Code tools in one model request. Use exec for 3+ dependent or fan-out tool calls, or when you can filter large tool results before they reach context. Call any tool by its name with tools.<name>(input); use await tools.list() to inspect available tools. Tool calls still pass through Claude Code permissions and hooks.

Example:
const read = await tools.Read({file_path:"README.md"});
const matches = await tools.Grep({pattern:"TODO", path:"src"});
return {firstLine:read.content.split("\n")[0], matches};
